cfg=dict(approved_by_main_reader=True,scan=18,base_reader='r2',brief_version='v006',changes=changes,c_doubts=q,unresolved=unresolved,inventory=inventory,notes=notes,notation=notation,abbreviations=copy.deepcopy(rs['r1']['abbreviations']),complete_tex=tex,main_crop_count=11,main_viewed_crops=mainview,adjudications=adjudications,workflow_observation='All three complete readings and reports compared. Main inspected 23 existing r2 crops, one r1 crop and 11 newly created crops, each once; no whole or half source reopened. Wider geometry/cancellation crops concern previously uninspected mark extents; incidental repeated text was not re-adjudicated. All 23 inline C marks receive explicit outcomes. v007 adds mechanically auditable C-mark coverage and clarifies underline versus italic state after the disagreement here.',adjudication_note='Main combines ink-supported alternatives rather than majority voting. Resolved old 7, source query, lower 3.1, final NB 9 and à la rigue; preserved uncertain top references, selected overprint components/order, appendix boundary and bottom insertion state. H’s deliberate omission of typewriter superpositions and accurate descriptions of drawings are acknowledged. No mathematical proof check occurred.')
